      "id": "claim_f5049d3391c7479baf38776d89ce8a5a",
      "statement": "Every internal module that imports a sibling uses a try/except relative-to-absolute import fallback (try `from ..mod`, then `from mod  # type: ignore`), because code is loaded both as a plugin subpackage and as top-level modules when a script bootstraps sys.path; preserve this exact shape when adding cross-module imports.",
