      "id": "claim_1d11f60a824846c68b2d645647594b33",
      "statement": "tests/conftest.py pins the repository's own `tests` package with `import tests  # noqa: E402` before any test module runs: the dispatcher import chain inserts foreign roots (e.g. ~/.hermes/hermes-agent) into sys.path, and without the pin that repo's own tests/ package would win `import tests` and break `from tests.unit...` imports (an order-dependent ModuleNotFoundError).",
